  "zh": "# 习近平抵达华盛顿开启国事访问，Claude发现新型酶系统\n## 国际视野\n- **习近平抵达华盛顿**：美方最高规格礼遇迎接，中美关系释放回暖信号。\n- **意大利议会投票重返核能**：时隔数十年逆转反核政策，欧洲能源路线再现分歧。\n- **莫斯科遭最大规模无人机袭击**：俄乌冲突无人机化再升级，防空压力骤增。\n## AI与科技\n- **Claude发现新型酶系统**：AI首次在生物学基础发现上取得突破，科研范式或被改写。\n- **Gemini 3.8文本转语音发布**：谷歌TTS能力再迭代，多模态竞赛进入新回合。\n- **Mercury 2.5 LLM达770 tokens/秒**：推理速度刷新纪录，成本战倒逼行业洗牌。\n## 开发者圈\n- **Linux将支持骁龙X2系列**：高通旗舰芯片终于补齐桌面Linux生态短板。\n- **ArXiv获多年期资助**：学术预印本平台转为独立非营利，开源基础设施再添保障。\n## 社会民生\n- **中国高等教育人口达2.7亿**：人口素质结构质变，但就业市场匹配仍是难题。\n- **打一针管数月降压疫苗将面世**：慢病管理从每日服药走向长效注射，依从性难题有望破解。",
  "en": "# Xi's Washington visit and Claude's novel enzyme discovery lead the day\n## Global Affairs\n- **Xi Jinping arrives in Washington**: Top-tier US welcome signals a thaw in China-US relations.\n- **Italy votes to return to nuclear energy**: Decades after Chernobyl, Rome reverses its anti-nuclear stance.\n- **Moscow hit by largest drone attack**: Russia-Ukraine conflict escalates with unprecedented UAV assault.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Claude discovers novel enzyme system**: AI's first fundamental biology breakthrough could reshape research paradigms.\n- **Gemini 3.8 text-to-speech launched**: Google's TTS upgrade intensifies the multimodal model race.\n- **Mercury 2.5 LLM hits 770 tokens/s**: Record inference speed heats up the cost war and industry shakeout.\n## Developer Circle\n- **Linux support coming to Snapdragon X2**: Qualcomm's flagship chips finally close the desktop Linux gap.\n- **ArXiv secures multiyear funding**: Preprint server goes independent nonprofit, bolstering open infrastructure.\n## Society\n- **China's college-educated population hits 270M**: A qualitative shift in demographics, but job matching lags.\n- **Long-acting blood pressure vaccine nears release**: Monthly hypertension shots could solve daily adherence problems."
